==Latin==

===Etymology===
Morphologically a derivative of {{m|la|mūs||mouse}} with diminutive meaning, thus "little mouse"; the "muscle" sense being a calque of {{cog|grc|μῦς||mouse; muscle}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Classical}} {{IPA|/ˈmuːs.ku.lus/|lang=la}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|mūsculus||mūsculī|m|second}}

# small [[mouse]]
# {{lb|la|anatomy}} [[muscle]]
# saltwater [[mussel]]
# {{lb|la|military}} [[mantelet]], [[shielding]]

====Inflection====
{{la-decl-2nd|mūscul}}

